WEBVTT

00:03.280 --> 00:04.680
Fire arrows.

00:06.240 --> 00:08.400
Archers follow my orders.

00:11.000 --> 00:12.400
Fire arrows.

00:17.640 --> 00:19.040
Fire arrows.

00:22.280 --> 00:23.640
No!

00:30.640 --> 00:34.400
Move forward no retreat, retreat and die.

00:38.680 --> 00:40.320
Archers, ready.

00:47.800 --> 00:53.440
The northern expedition may one day succeed but they will never see it.

00:54.120 --> 00:58.720
The stench of blood rises beneath the walls you feel your throat tighten Your stomach churns.

00:58.800 --> 01:02.840
But you remain standing on the city walls you know.

01:02.920 --> 01:08.720
You will never forget this day for the rest of your life when we finally defeat the Wuzhao.

01:08.840 --> 01:10.920
You will repay them a hundredfold.

01:11.800 --> 01:13.200
Fire arrows.

01:46.560 --> 01:48.000
Fire arrows.

01:49.500 --> 01:58.500
Wu Junren drove waves of displaced refugees against the city walls for three days straight. The defending troops atop the walls showed no mercy, and the corpses of the refugees mingled with dirt and stones, piling into a marsh of flesh and blood beneath the city walls...

